helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150793				0	tg	This section describes the basic syntax elements of $[officename] Basic. For a detailed description please refer to the $[officename] Basic Guide which is available separately.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
