helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155259				0	tg	Initially, the controls receive numbers in the order they are added to the dialog. You can change the order numbers for controls. $[officename] Basic updates the order numbers automatically to avoid duplicate numbers. Controls that cannot be focused are also assigned a value but these controls are skipped when using the Tab key.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155334				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specify the desired format for a date control. A date control interprets the user input depending on this format setting.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155401				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specify the maximum time value for a time control.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155509				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specify the edit mask for a pattern control. This is a character code that defines the input format for the control.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
