helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155855				0	tg	Define the properties for the selected control or dialog. The available properties depend on the type of control selected. The following properties therefore are not available for every type of control.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155930				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select "Yes" to prevent the user from editing the value of the current control. The control is enabled and can be focussed but not modified.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
