helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3146114				0	tg	Define event assignments for the selected control or dialog. The available events depend on the type of control selected.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3148608				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_TEXTCHANGED\"\>This event takes place if you enter or modify a text in an input field.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3148837				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_KEYTYPED\"\>This event occurs when the user presses any key while the control has the focus.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3149697				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSEMOVED\"\>This event takes place when the mouse moves over the control.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150403				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSEDRAGGED\"\>This event takes place when the mouse is dragged while a key is pressed.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
