helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3153305				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_FOCUSLOST\"\>This event takes place if a control loses the focus.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3153812				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSERELEASED\"\>This event takes place when the mouse button is released while the mouse pointer is on the control.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
