helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3155097				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_ITEMSTATECHANGED\"\>This event takes place if the status of the control field is changed, for example, from checked to unchecked.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
