helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020404.xhp	0	help	par_id3154012	18			0	tg	To generate a list of all existing files in a specific directory, proceed as follows: The first time you call the Dir function, specify the complete search path for the files, for example, "D:\\Files\\*.sxw". If the path is correct and the search finds at least one file, the Dir function returns the name of the first file that matches the search path. To return additional file names that match the path, call Dir again, but with no arguments.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
