helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030101.xhp	0	help	par_id3151043				0	tg	\<emph\>Day:\</emph\> Integer expression that indicates the day of the specified month. The accepted range is from 1-31. No error is returned when you enter a non-existing day for a month shorter than 31 days. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
