helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155306				0	tg	The \<emph\>DateSerial function\</emph\> returns the data type Variant with VarType 7 (Date). Internally, this value is stored as a Double value, so that when the given date is 1.1.1900, the returned value is 2. Negative values correspond to dates before December 30, 1899 (not inclusive).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
