helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030102.xhp	0	help	par_id3146974				0	tg	In contrast to the DateSerial function that passes years, months, and days as separate numeric values, the DateValue function passes the date using the format "month.[,]day.[,]year".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
