helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030205.xhp	0	help	par_id3149482				0	tg	In the TimeValue function, you can pass a string as a parameter containing the time. For the TimeSerial function, however, you can pass the individual parameters (hour, minute, second) as separate numeric expressions.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
