helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090203.xhp	0	help	par_id3151041				0	tg	Unlike the \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03090201.xhp\" name=\"Do...Loop\"\>Do...Loop\</link\> statement, you cannot cancel a \<emph\>While...Wend\</emph\> loop with \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03090412.xhp\" name=\"Exit\"\>Exit\</link\>. Never exit a While...Wend loop with \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03090302.xhp\" name=\"GoTo\"\>GoTo\</link\>, since this can cause a run-time error.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
