helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145171				0	tg	The following example uses the \<emph\>CBool\</emph\> function to evaluate the value that is returned by the \<emph\>Instr\</emph\> function. The function checks if the word "and" is found in the sentence that was entered by the user.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
