helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149018				0	tg	Variable fields, regardless of type, can be made dynamic if they are dimensioned by ReDim at the procedure level in subroutines or functions. Normally, you can only set the range of an array once and you cannot modify it. Within a procedure, you can declare an array using the ReDim statement with numeric expressions to define the range of the field sizes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
