helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_protect.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146119				0	tg	\<variable id=\"cell_protect\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/cell_protect.xhp\" name=\"Protecting Cells from Changes\"\>Ҳифзи чашмакҳо аз ислоҳкунӣ\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_protect.xhp	0	help	par_id3145261				0	tg	Protection can be provided by means of a password, but it does not have to be. If you have assigned a password, protection can only be removed once the correct password has been entered.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_protect.xhp	0	help	par_id3145362				0	tg	Параметрҳои ҳифзкуниро истифода баред.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_protect.xhp	0	help	par_id3148576				0	tg	Note that the cell protection for cells with the \<emph\>Protected\</emph\> attribute is only effective when you protect the whole table. In the default condition, every cell has the \<emph\>Protected\</emph\> attribute. Therefore you must remove the attribute selectively for those cells where the user may make changes. You then protect the whole table and save the document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_protect.xhp	0	help	par_id3149019				0	tg	\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Формат - Чашмакҳо\</item\> ро интихоб карда ба саҳифаи \<emph\>Ҳифзи чашмак\</emph\> гузаред.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
