helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000007.xhp	0	help	par_id3149748	9			0	tg	\<variable id=\"diaobjektleiste\"\>Тасвир дар лавҳаи Намоиши Слайд: \</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
