helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151351				0	tg	To break the link between the document and the missing template, click \<emph\>No\</emph\>, otherwise \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> will look for the template the next time you open the document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
