helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152360	46			0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCDLG_INSCONT:BTN_INSNUMBERS\"\>\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>Inserts cells containing numbers. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
