helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159196	23			0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_INSCONT:BTN_OP_ADD\"\>\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>Adds the values in the clipboard cells to the values in the target cells. Also, if the clipboard only contains notes, adds the notes to the target cells. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
