helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151101				0	tg	After you close the \<emph\>Find & Replace\</emph\> dialog, you can still search using the last search criteria that you entered, by pressing Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
