helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100000.xhp	0	help	par_idN109CC				0	tg	After you select the attributes that you want to search for, the \<emph\>Search for Styles\</emph\> box in the \<emph\>Options \</emph\>area of the %PRODUCTNAME Writer \<emph\>Find & Replace \</emph\>dialog changes to \<emph\>Including Styles\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
