helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147009				0	tg	To detach the \<emph\>Color Bar\</emph\>, click on a gray area of the toolbar while holding down Ctrl, and then drag. To reattach the \<emph\>Color Bar\</emph\>, hold down Ctrl and drag the title bar of the toolbar to the edge of the window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147399				0	tg	You can also drag a color from the \<emph\>Color Bar\</emph\> and drop it on a draw object on your slide.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
