helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154186				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_COLOR_CTL_COLORS\"\>Click the color that you want to use. To change the fill color of an object in the current file, select the object and then click a color. To change the line color of the selected object, right-click a color. To change the color of text in a text object, double-click the text-object, select the text, and then click a color.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
