helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	par_id3153795				0	tg	To specify a calendar format that is independent of the locale, add a modifier in front of the date format. For example, to display a date using the Jewish calendar format in a non-Hebrew locale, enter: [~jewish]DD/MM/YYYY.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
