helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05210500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149495				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AREA_BITMAP\"\>Select a bitmap that you want to use as a fill pattern, or create your own pixel pattern. You can also import bitmaps, and save or load bitmap lists.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
