helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152909				0	tg	To edit the individual objects of a group, select the group, right-click, and then choose \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"DRAW\"\>\<emph\>Enter Group\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Group - Enter Group\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153323				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Groups keep together selected objects, so that they can be moved or formatted as a single object.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153541				0	tg	Use Tab and Shift+Tab to move forwards and backwards through the objects in a group.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154810				0	tg	To exit a group, right-click, and then choose \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"DRAW\"\>\<emph\>Exit Group\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Group - Exit Group\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159158				0	tg	When you are editing a group, the objects that are not part of the group are faded.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
