helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340300.xhp	0	help	par_id3148555				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:TRISTATEBOX:RID_SVXPAGE_ALIGNMENT:BTN_WRAP\"\>Wraps text onto another line at the cell border. The number of lines depends on the width of the cell. To enter a manual line break, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Enter in the cell.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
