helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010600.xhp	0	help	par_idN10557				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Translates the selected Chinese text from one Chinese writing system to the other. If no text is selected, the entire document is translated.\</ahelp\> You can only use this command if you enable Asian language support in \<emph\>Tools - Options - Language Settings - Languages\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
