helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010600.xhp	0	help	par_idN1058E				0	tg	Common terms				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010600.xhp	0	help	par_idN10592				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Common terms are words that have the same meaning in traditional and simplified Chinese but are written with different characters.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010600.xhp	0	help	par_idN10595				0	tg	Translate Common Terms				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010600.xhp	0	help	par_idN10599				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Translates words with two or more characters that are in the list of common terms. After the list is scanned, the remaining text is translated character by character.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
