helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010601.xhp	0	help	par_idN10566				0	tg	You can use this dialog to edit, to add, or to delete entries from the translation dictionary. The file path name for the translation dictionary is user/wordbook/commonterms.ctd. You cannot delete the default entries in this file.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
