helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153124				0	tg	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>In text documents, you can choose to apply the AutoCorrect errors while you type [T], or only when you modify existing text [M] with \<emph\>Format - AutoFormat - Apply\</emph\>. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153127				0	tg	This feature does not work if the formatting characters * or _ are entered with an \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#IME\" name=\"Input Method Editor\"\>Input Method Editor\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
