helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153577				0	tg	Automatically applies bold formatting to text enclosed by asterisks (*), and underline to text enclosed by underscores ( _ ), for example, *bold*. The asterisks and underscores are not displayed after the formatting is applied.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
