helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\extensionupdate.xhp	0	help	par_id3372295				0	tg	If all updates have been processed the Download and Installation dialog shows that it has finished. You can abort the download and installation process by clicking the \<emph\>Abort Update\</emph\> button.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\extensionupdate.xhp	0	help	par_id5084688				0	tg	Click the \<emph\>Updates\</emph\> button in the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/packagemanager.xhp\"\>Extension Manager\</link\> to check for online updates for all installed extensions. To check for online updates for only the selected extensions, right-click to open the context menu, then choose \<emph\>Update\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\extensionupdate.xhp	0	help	par_id5189062				0	tg	All extensions which can be directly downloaded are downloaded now. The progress is shown in the Download and Installation dialog. If an extension cannot be downloaded, a message is displayed. The operation continues for the remaining extensions.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\extensionupdate.xhp	0	help	par_id5841242				0	tg	While checking for updates, you see a progress indicator. Wait for some messages to show up in the dialog, or click Cancel to abort the update check.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\extensionupdate.xhp	0	help	par_id616779				0	tg	Insufficient user rights (the Extension Manager was started from the menu, but shared extensions can only be modified when %PRODUCTNAME does not run, and only by a user with appropriate rights).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\extensionupdate.xhp	0	help	par_id6401257				0	tg	When you click the Updates button or choose the Update command, the Extension Update dialog is displayed and the check for availability of updates starts immediately.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\extensionupdate.xhp	0	help	par_id641193				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>By default, only the downloadable extensions are shown in the dialog. Mark \<emph\>Show all Updates\</emph\> to see also other extensions and error messages.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\extensionupdate.xhp	0	help	par_id6420484				0	tg	The Extension Update dialog may contain entries which are not selectable and hence no automatic update can be performed. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\extensionupdate.xhp	0	help	par_id6794030				0	tg	If no updates are available, the message in the dialog tells you there are no updates. Close the dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\extensionupdate.xhp	0	help	par_id6854457				0	tg	After the last extension has been downloaded, the installation begins. First all installed extensions for which an update could be downloaded successfully, are removed. Then the updated extensions are installed. If an error occurs, a message that the installation failed is displayed, but the operation proceeds.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\extensionupdate.xhp	0	help	par_id6986602				0	tg	Dependencies are not fulfilled (the update needs some more or newer files to be installed).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\extensionupdate.xhp	0	help	par_id7096774				0	tg	If updates are available, the updates can either be installed automatically, or you must respond with some action:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\extensionupdate.xhp	0	help	par_id757469				0	tg	When you click the Download and Install button the Download and Installation dialog is displayed. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
