helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145601				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:NumericField\"\>Creates a numerical field.\</ahelp\> If the form is linked to a database, the numerical values in the form can be adopted from the database.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145615				0	tg	Group boxes are used only for a visual effect. A functional grouping of option fields can be made through the name definition: under the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170101.xhp\" name=\"Name\"\>\<emph\>Name\</emph\>\</link\> properties of all option fields, enter the same name in order to group them.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145801				0	tg	\<image id=\"img_id3151073\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_insertpushbutton.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3151073\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147046				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Pushbutton\"\>Creates a push button.\</ahelp\> This function can be used to execute a command for a defined event, such as a mouse click.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147336				0	tg	Icon in the \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> bar:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147547				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FormattedField\"\>Creates a formatted field.\</ahelp\> A formatted field is a text box in which you can define how the inputs and outputs are formatted, and which limiting values apply.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148394				0	tg	If you insert a group frame into the document, the \<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/01120000.xhp\" name=\"Group Element Wizard\"\>Group Element Wizard\</link\> starts, which allows you to easily create an option group.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148483				0	tg	\<image id=\"img_id3156380\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_checkbox.png\" width=\"0.1665inch\" height=\"0.1665inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3156380\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148534				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Label\"\>Creates a field for displaying text.\</ahelp\> These labels are only for displaying predefined text. Entries cannot be made in these fields.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148601				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Imagebutton\"\>Creates a button displayed as an image.\</ahelp\> Aside from the graphic representation, an image button has the same properties as a "normal" button.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148645				0	tg	Right-click the control and choose \<emph\>Control\</emph\>. A dialog opens where you can define the properties of the control.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149123				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:RadioButton\"\>Creates an option button.\</ahelp\> Option buttons enable the user to choose one of several options. Option buttons with the same functionality are given the same name (\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170101.xhp\" name=\"Name\"\>\<emph\>Name\</emph\>\</link\>\<emph\>property\</emph\>). Normally, they are given a \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170000.xhp\" name=\"group box\"\>group box\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149396				0	tg	\<image id=\"img_id3153012\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_insertnumericfield.png\" width=\"0.0874inch\" height=\"0.0874inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153012\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149407				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ComboBox\"\>Creates a combo box.\</ahelp\> A combo box is a single-line list box with a drop-down list from which users choose an option. You can assign the "read-only" property to the combo box so that users cannot enter other entries than those found in the list. If the form is bound to a database and the database connection is active, the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170900.xhp\" name=\"Combo Box Wizard\"\>\<emph\>Combo Box Wizard\</emph\>\</link\> will automatically appear after you insert the combo box in the document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149423				0	tg	\<image id=\"img_id3150096\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_adddatefield.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150096\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149438				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FileControl\"\>Creates a button that enables file selection.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149596				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ImageControl\"\>Creates an image control. It can only be used to add images from a database.\</ahelp\> In the form document, double-click one of these controls to open the \<emph\>Insert Graphic\</emph\> dialog to insert the image. There is also a context menu (not in design mode) with commands for inserting and deleting the image.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149670				0	tg	Form Controls				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149742				0	tg	\<image id=\"img_id3148924\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_insertpatternfield.png\" width=\"0.1665inch\" height=\"0.1665inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3148924\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149981				0	tg	\<image id=\"img_id3148817\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_combobox.png\" width=\"0.1665inch\" height=\"0.1665inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3148817\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150122				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:PatternField\"\>Creates a pattern field.\</ahelp\> Pattern fields consist of an edit mask and a literal mask. The edit mask determines which data can be entered. The literal mask determines the contents of the pattern field when loading the form.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150261				0	tg	\<image id=\"img_id3149351\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_autocontrolfocus.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149351\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150318				0	tg	Images from a database can be displayed in a form, and new images can be inserted in the database as long as the image control is not write-protected. The control must refer to a database field of the image type. Therefore, enter the data field into the properties window on the \<emph\>Data\</emph\> tab page.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150470				0	tg	This icon switches the mouse pointer to the select mode, or deactivates this mode. The select mode is used to select the controls of the current form.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150531				0	tg	\<image id=\"img_id3154344\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_filecontrol.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154344\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150567				0	tg	\<emph\>Note:\</emph\> When you drag a group box over already existing controls and then want to select a control, you have to first open the context menu of the group box and choose \<emph\>Arrange - Send to Back\</emph\>. Then select the control while pressing \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150791				0	tg	When you create a form in an HTML document, you can use the form to send data over the Internet.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151302				0	tg	If you assign the "Dropdown" property to the date field, the user can open a calendar to select a date under the date field. This also applies to a date field within a Table Control field.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151312				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DateField\"\>Creates a date field.\</ahelp\> If the form is linked to a database, the date values can be adopted from the database.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151378				0	tg	\<variable id=\"formulartext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Config\"\>The Form Controls icon opens a toolbar with the tools that you need to create an interactive form.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> You can use the toolbar to add controls to a form in a text, spreadsheet, presentation, or HTML document, for example a button that runs a macro.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152771				0	tg	To create a form, open a document and use the Form Controls toolbar to add and define the form controls. If you want, you can also link the form to a database, so that you can use the controls to manipulate a database.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152792	135			0	tg	You can drag and drop controls from one document to another document. You can also copy and paste controls between documents. When you insert a control from another document, $[officename] analyzes the data source, content type, and content properties of the control so that the control fits the logical structure in the target document. For example, a control that displays contents from an address book continues to display the same contents after you copy the control to a different document. You can view these properties on the \<emph\>Data\</emph\> tab page of the \<emph\>Form properties\</emph\> dialog. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152947				0	tg	Please note that pattern fields are not exported into HTML format.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152971				0	tg	\<image id=\"img_id3152999\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_radiobutton.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3152999\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153112				0	tg	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170003.xhp\" name=\"Specific Remarks on Date Fields\"\>Specific Remarks on Date Fields\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153363				0	tg	To specify a accelerator key for a control, add a tilde (~) in front of the character in the label for the control.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153687				0	tg	\<image id=\"img_id3155949\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_timefield.png\" width=\"0.1665inch\" height=\"0.1665inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3155949\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153927				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:CheckBox\"\>Creates a check box.\</ahelp\> Check boxes allow you to activate or deactivate a function in a form.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154127				0	tg	To add a field from the field list of a table or query to a form, drag a cell into the form. In a text document, you can also drag a column header to add a field to a form. To include a label for the field, hold down the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift key down when you drag a column head.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154326				0	tg	\<image id=\"img_id3154135\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_listbox.png\" width=\"0.1665inch\" height=\"0.1665inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154135\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154395				0	tg	Date fields can be easily edited by the user with the up arrow and down arrow keys. Depending on the cursor position, the day, month, or the year is can be increased or decreased using the arrow keys.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154572				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:GroupBox\"\>Creates a frame to visually group several controls.\</ahelp\> Group boxes allow you to group option buttons in a frame.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154579				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Creates a table control to display a database table.\</ahelp\> If you create a new table control, the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170800.xhp\" name=\"Table Element Wizard\"\>Table Element Wizard\</link\> appears.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154697				0	tg	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170004.xhp\" name=\"Special Information about Table Controls\"\>Special information about Table Controls\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154731				0	tg	You can apply text and graphics to these buttons.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154764				0	tg	Time fields can be easily edited by the user with the up and down arrow keys. Depending on the cursor position, the hours, minutes, or the seconds are increased or decreased using the arrow keys.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154836				0	tg	\<image id=\"img_id3143277\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_formattedfield.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3143277\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154918				0	tg	On the Form Controls toolbar, click the icon of the control that you want to add.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
