helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11B76				0	tg	Turns on and turns off the automatic form controls wizards.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CA3				0	tg	You can specify the following properties for a scrollbar:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CDA				0	tg	UI name				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CE0				0	tg	Semantics				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CE7				0	tg	Scroll value min				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CED				0	tg	Specifies the minimum height or the minimum width of a scrollbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CF4				0	tg	Scroll value max				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CFA				0	tg	Specifies the maximum height or the maximum width of a scrollbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D01				0	tg	Default Scroll value				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D07				0	tg	Specifies the default height or the default width of a scrollbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D0E				0	tg	Ориентатсия				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D14				0	tg	Specifies the orientation of a scrollbar, that is, horizontal or vertical.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D1B				0	tg	Small change				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D21				0	tg	Specifies the minimum amount by which you can scroll a scrollbar, for example, by clicking an arrow.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D28				0	tg	Large change				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D2E				0	tg	Specifies the amount that a large step scrolls a scrollbar, for example, when you click between the scrollbar thumb and a scrollbar arrow.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D35				0	tg	Андармонӣ				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D3B				0	tg	Specifies the delay in milliseconds between scrollbar trigger events. For example, the delay that occurs when you click an arrow button on the scrollbar and hold down the mouse button.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D42				0	tg	Symbol color				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D48				0	tg	Specifies the color of the arrows on the scrollbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D4F				0	tg	Visible Size				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D55				0	tg	Specifies the size of the scrollbar thumb in "value units". For example, a value of ("Scroll value max." minus "Scroll value min.") / 2 results in a scrollbar thumb that occupies half of the scrollbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D58				0	tg	To make the width of the scrollbar equal to the height of the scrollbar, set the Visible Size to zero.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D63				0	tg	In a Calc spreadsheet, you can use the Data tab page to create a two-way link between a scrollbar and a cell.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11DB1				0	tg	The navigation bar allows you to move through the records of a database or a database form. The controls on this navigation bar work the same way as the controls on the default \<link href=\"text/shared/main0213.xhp\"\>navigation bar\</link\> in $[officename].				2002-02-02 02:02:02
