helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149235	75			0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_LINECOUNT\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies how many lines should be displayed in the dropdown list. This setting is only active if you chose "Yes" in the "Dropdown" option.\</ahelp\>For combo boxes with the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170101.xhp\" name=\"Dropdown\"\>Dropdown\</link\> property, you can specify how many lines should be displayed in the dropdown list. With control fields which do not have the Dropdown option, the line's display will be specified by the size of the control field and the font size.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
