helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149819	10			0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_NAME\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>On the \<emph\>Properties\</emph\> tab page, specifies the name for the control field. On the \<emph\>Form Properties \</emph\>tab page, specifies the name for the form.\</ahelp\>Each control field and each form has a \<emph\>Name \</emph\>property through which it can be identified. The name will appear in the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170600.xhp\" name=\"Form Navigator\"\>Form Navigator\</link\> and, using the name, the control field can be referred to from a macro. A name is already entered in the default settings. The control field is specified by its name which is constructed from using the field's label and number.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149918	198			0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_NAVIGATIONBAR\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies whether to display the navigation bar on the lower border of the table control.\</ahelp\> Specifies whether to display the navigation bar on the lower border of table controls.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150010				0	tg	Opens the URL that is specified under \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170101.xhp\" name=\"URL\"\>\<emph\>URL\</emph\>\</link\>. You can use \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170101.xhp\" name=\"Frame\"\>\<emph\>Frame\</emph\>\</link\> to specify the target frame.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150028	203			0	tg	For a \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170101.xhp\" name=\"Reset type\"\>Reset type\</link\> button, the\<emph\> Default selection\</emph\> entry defines the status of the list box if the reset button is activated by the user.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150084				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_ENABLED\"\>If a control field has the property "Enabled" (Yes), the form user will be able to use the control field.\</ahelp\> If the property is disabled, it will not be enabled (No) and will be displayed in a gray color.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150271				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_CURRSYM_POSITION\"\>Determines if the currency symbol is displayed before or after the number when using currency fields.\</ahelp\> The default setting is currency symbols are not prefixed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150378				0	tg	When creating a form, an index is automatically assigned to the control fields that are added to this form; every control field added is assigned an index increased by 1. If you change the index of a control, the indices of the other controls are updated automatically. Elements that cannot be focused (\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170101.xhp\" name=\"Tabstop\"\>Tabstop\</link\> = No) are also assigned a value. However, these controls are skipped when using the Tab key.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150429				0	tg	All printable characters can be entered. If a lowercase letter is used, it is automatically converted to a capital letter.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
