helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150931				0	tg	When using Web page forms, you might come across this property in search masks. These are edit masks that contain a text field and a button to with the action "Submit form" is applied. The search term is entered in the text field and the search is started by activating the button. If the button is defined as the default button, however, simply hit Enter after entering the search term in order to start the search.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
