helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11578				0	tg	Hide selection				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN1158E				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"37965\"\>Specifies whether a text selection on a control remains selected when a the focus is no longer on a control.\</ahelp\> If you set \<emph\>Hide selection\</emph\> to "No", the selected text remains selected when the focus is no longer on the control that contains the text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
