helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154751				0	tg	Ҳошия				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155419				0	tg	Data transfer of control information				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3145065				0	tg	Using the "Get" method, the data of every control is transmitted as an environment variable. They are appended to the URL in the form "?Control1=Content1&Control2=Content2&..."; the character string is analyzed by a program on the recipient's server.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3145419				0	tg	The values of pattern fields are sent as text fields, that is, the value visible in the form is sent.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3146794				0	tg	The date format is sent in a fixed format (MM-DD-YYYY), regardless of the user's local settings.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3147226				0	tg	Specifies the URL to which the data of the completed form is to be transmitted.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3148563				0	tg	Date field				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149670				0	tg	Time field				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149734				0	tg	A decimal separator is always displayed as a period.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150443				0	tg	Using the "Post" method, a document is created from the content of the form that is sent to the specified URL.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150767				0	tg	Table control				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150789				0	tg	Specifies a name for the form. This name is used to identify the form in the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170600.xhp\" name=\"Form Navigator\"\>Form Navigator\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150984				0	tg	How this information is transmitted depends on the selected transfer method (Get or Post) and the coding (URL or Multipart). If the Get method and URL encoding are selected, for example, value pairs in the form <Name>=<Value> are sent.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3152933				0	tg	From the table control, the individual columns are always transmitted. The name of the control, the name of the column, and the value of the column are sent. Using the Get method with URL encoding, the transmission is done in the form <Name of the table control>.<Name of the column>=<Value>, for example, with the value being dependent on the column.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153252				0	tg	Which values are transmitted in each case depends on the respective control. For text fields, the visible entries are transmitted; for list boxes, the selected entries are transmitted; for check boxes and option fields, the associated reference values are transmitted if these fields were activated.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153361				0	tg	Pattern field				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153539				0	tg	A form is a text document or spreadsheet with different form controls. If you create a form for a Web page, the user can enter data into it to send over the Internet. The data from the form controls of a form is transmitted to a server by specifying a URL and can be processed on the server.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153562				0	tg	Value Pair				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153698				0	tg	Элементи идоракунӣ				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153717				0	tg	When sending a form, all controls available in $[officename] are taken into consideration. The name of the control and the corresponding value, if available, are transmitted.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153779				0	tg	The time format is sent in a fixed format (HH:MM:SS), regardless of the user's local settings.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153823				0	tg	Numeric field, currency field				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3154823				0	tg	Defines the target frame in which the loaded URL is to appear.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3155338				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_SUBMIT_METHOD\"\>Specifies the method to transfer the completed form information.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3157909				0	tg	In addition to the controls that are recognized in HTML, $[officename] offers other controls. It should be noted that, for fields with a specific numerical format, the visible values are not transmitted but rather fixed default formats. The following table shows how the data of the $[officename]-specific controls is transmitted:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
