helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148550				0	tg	\<variable id=\"vorschautext\"\>You can see the name of the fonts formatted in their respective font if you mark the \<emph\>Preview in fonts lists\</emph\> field in \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010800.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options - $[officename] - View\"\>Tools - Options - $[officename] - View\</link\>. \</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
