helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149355				0	tg	When searching a table, the data fields of the current table are searched. When searching in a form, the data fields of the table linked with the form are searched.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149401				0	tg	The following examples show possible issues when searching without field formatting. These issues depend on the database used and only occur for certain internal default formatting:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
