helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\19090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149760				0	tg	In HTML Source mode, you can view and edit the \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#tags\" name=\"tags\"\>tags\</link\> of \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#html\" name=\"HTML\"\>HTML\</link\>. Save the document as a plain text document. Assign an .html or .htm extension to designate the document as HTML.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
