helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147243				0	tg	In the insert mode, new text is inserted at the cursor position and the following text is shifted to the right. The cursor is displayed as a vertical line.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
