helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3146842				0	tg	If you enter the SQL code manually, you can create SQL-specific queries that are not supported by the graphical interface in \<emph\>Query design\</emph\>. These queries must be executed in native SQL mode.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
