helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145382				0	tg	Open the Form Controls toolbar. The Form Controls toolbar contains the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170000.xhp\" name=\"functions\"\>functions\</link\> needed to edit a form. More functions can be found in the \<emph\>Form Design\</emph\> bar and \<emph\>More Controls\</emph\> bar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153146				0	tg	In the form design you can \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170000.xhp\" name=\"include controls\"\>include controls\</link\>, \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170100.xhp\" name=\"apply properties\"\>apply properties\</link\> to them, define \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170200.xhp\" name=\"Form properties\"\>Form properties\</link\>, and \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170203.xhp\" name=\"define subforms\"\>define subforms\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153968	6			0	tg	The \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01171000.xhp\" name=\"Open in Design Mode\"\>\<emph\>Open in Design Mode\</emph\>\</link\> icon \<image id=\"img_id1871395\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_openreadonly.png\" width=\"5.59mm\" height=\"5.59mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id1871395\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> allows you to save a form document so that it always opens in editing mode.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154230				0	tg	Any $[officename] document can be expanded into a form. Simply add one or more form controls.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154924	9			0	tg	The\<emph\> Form Navigator\</emph\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3156002\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_showfmexplorer.png\" width=\"4.23mm\" height=\"4.23mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3156002\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> on the Form Object bar opens the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170600.xhp\" name=\"Form Navigator\"\>\<emph\>Form Navigator\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154948				0	tg	If there is an error when assigning properties to the objects contained in the form (for example, when assigning a non-existent database table to an object), a corresponding error message appears. This error message may contain a \<emph\>More\</emph\> button. \<ahelp hid=\"dummy\"\>If you click \<emph\>More\</emph\>, a dialog displaying more information about the current problem appears.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
