helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3146958				0	tg	Depending on the context, it is possible that not all the functions for your current database are listed in the context menus. For example, the \<emph\>Relationships\</emph\> command for defining relationships between various tables is only available with relational databases.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
