helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155132				0	tg	Пӯшонидан				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147085	20			0	tg	The\<emph\> Fields\</emph\> area displays a list of fields in the current table. You can also select multiple fields. In order to remove a field from the selection, select the empty entry at the start of the list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148563				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGIDX_SAVEINDEX\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Saves the current index in the data source.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148685				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGIDX_RENAMEINDEX\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Renames the current index.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149561				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGINDEX_INDEXDETAILS_SORTORDER\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Determines the sort order.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150085				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGIDX_NEWINDEX\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Creates a new index.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154190				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"DBACCESS_PUSHBUTTON_DLG_INDEXDESIGN_PB_CLOSE\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Closes the dialog.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154758				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGIDX_RESETINDEX\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Resets the current index to the setting that it had when the dialog was started.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154860				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGIDX_DROPINDEX\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Deletes the current index.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154938	16			0	tg	As soon as you change a detail of the current index and then select another index, the change is immediately passed to the data source. You can only leave the dialog, or select another index, if the change has been successfully acknowledged by the data source. However, you can undo the change by clicking  the \<emph\>Reset Current Index \</emph\>icon.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155342				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGIDX_INDEXLIST\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Displays the available indexes. Select an index from the list to edit.\</ahelp\> The corresponding details of the selected index are then visible on the right side of the dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156282	18			0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"DBACCESS_CHECKBOX_DLG_INDEXDESIGN_CB_UNIQUE\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Specifies whether the current index allows only unique values.\</ahelp\> Checking the \<emph\>Unique \</emph\>option prevents duplicate data from being entered in the field and ensures data integrity.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3158408				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGINDEX_INDEXDETAILS_FIELD\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Displays the a list fields in the current table. You can select more than one field.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3166460	2			0	tg	\<ahelp visibility=\"visible\" hid=\".uno:DBIndexDesign\"\>The \<emph\>Index Design \</emph\>dialog allows you edit the indexes for the current table.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	tg	Index design				2002-02-02 02:02:02
