helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146135	84			0	tg	On the server, start the x_server program in \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"UNIX\"\>adabas\\bin \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Adabas\\bin\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> directory.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
