helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabaadvpropgen.xhp	0	help	par_idN10590				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enables $[officename] support for auto-incremented data fields in the current ODBC or JDBC data source. Select this option if the auto-increment feature in the SDBCX layer of the database is not supported. In general, the auto-increment is selected for the primary key field.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
