helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabaadvpropgen.xhp	0	help	par_idN10597				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enter the SQL command specifier that instructs the data source to auto-increment a specified Integer data field.\</ahelp\> For example, the following MySQL statement used the AUTO_INCREMENT statement to increase the "id" field each time the statement creates a data field:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabaadvpropgen.xhp	0	help	par_idN105A0				0	tg	CREATE TABLE "table1" ("id" INTEGER AUTO_INCREMENT)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
