helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\menuedit.xhp	0	help	par_idN1056B				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Inserts an item from the clipboard. If you want, you can insert forms and reports, including subfolders, from one database file to another.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
