helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\menufile.xhp	0	help	par_idN105C4				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Saves the current database file, query, form or report. For the database file, you see the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01070000.xhp\"\>file save\</link\> dialog. For the other objects, you see the \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/menufilesave.xhp\"\>Save\</link\> dialog.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
