helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\menufile.xhp	0	help	par_idN105FC				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the default e-mail application to send a new e-mail. The current database file is appended as an attachment. You can enter the subject, the recipients and a mail body.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
