helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\copytable2application.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154186				0	tg	\<bookmark_value\>tables; inserting spreadsheet cells\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>inserting; cell ranges from spreadsheets\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>pasting;cell ranges from spreadsheets\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>presentations;inserting spreadsheet cells\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>text documents;inserting spreadsheet cells\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
