helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_im_export.xhp	0	help	par_id325632				0	tg	For example, to ensure the first column has a text format, you must make sure that the first field of the first valid data row contains text. If a field in the first valid data row contains a number, the whole column is set to number format, and only numbers, no text, will be shown in that column. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
