helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_im_export.xhp	0	help	par_id8494521				0	tg	You can import text files, spreadsheet files, and your system address book in read-only mode only. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_im_export.xhp	0	help	par_id9579760				0	tg	When you import from a text or spreadsheet file, the file must have a first row of header information. The second row of the file is the first valid data row. The format of every field in the second row determines the format for the entire column. Any format information from a spreadsheet file gets lost when importing to Base.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
