helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_search.xhp	0	help	par_id3150774				0	tg	Агар шумо матнро дар ҳуҷҷат интихоб намуда бошед, он автоматӣ илова карда мешавад.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_search.xhp	0	help	par_id3153662				0	tg	Тасвири \<emph\>Ёфтан\</emph\>ро пахш намуда зерменюро кушоед.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_search.xhp	0	help	par_id3154751				0	tg	Истифода кардани лавҳаи \<emph\>Гиперҳавола\</emph\> барои ҷустуҷӯи матни интихобшуда дар Интернет имкон дорад.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_search.xhp	0	help	par_id3159157				0	tg	\<link href=\"text/shared/main0209.xhp\" name=\"Hyperlink Bar\"\>Лавҳаи Гиперҳавола\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_search.xhp	0	help	par_idN10620				0	tg	\<emph\>Намоиш - Лавҳаҳо - Гиперҳавола\</emph\>ро интихоб намуда Лавҳаи Гиперҳаволаро кушоед.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_search.xhp	0	help	par_idN10657				0	tg	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01020200.xhp\" name=\"Search function in the Hyperlink Bar\"\>\<emph\>Асбобҳо - Параметрҳо - Интернет - Ҷустуҷӯ\</emph\>\</link\>ро пахш намуда параметрҳои ҷустуҷӯро гузоред.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_search.xhp	0	help	tit				0	tg	Ҷустуҷӯ бо лавҳаи Гиперҳавола				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150502				0	tg	\<bookmark_value\>ImageMap; editor\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>editors; ImageMap\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>images; ImageMap\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>pictures; ImageMap\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	par_idN10631				0	tg	\<variable id=\"imagemap\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/imagemap.xhp\"\>Adding Clickable Hotspots to Images\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	par_idN1064F				0	tg	An ImageMap allows you to attach URLs to specific areas, called hotspots, on a picture in your document. An image map is a group of one or more hotspots.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	par_idN1066C				0	tg	You can draw three types of hotspots: rectangles, ellipses, and polygons. When you click a hotspot, the URL is opened in the browser window or frame that you specify. You can also specify the text that appears when your mouse rests on the hotspot.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	par_idN10677				0	tg	To add a clickable hotspot to an image				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	par_idN1067E				0	tg	Position the cursor where you want the ImageMap in your document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	par_idN10682				0	tg	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Picture - From File\</emph\>, select and insert a bitmap picture.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	par_idN1068A				0	tg	With the picture selected, choose \<emph\>Edit - ImageMap\</emph\>. You see the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/02220000.xhp\"\>ImageMap Editor\</link\>, which displays the picture at the background.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	par_idN106A0				0	tg	Use the icons in the ImageMap Editor to draw a hotspot shape, for example a rectangle, over the image at the background.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	par_idN106A3				0	tg	You can see an extended help text on the functions of each icon when you enable Extended Help in \<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME - General\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	par_idN106AB				0	tg	Enter the "Address" URL that will be shown in a Web browser when the user clicks the hotspot.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	par_idN106AF				0	tg	Optionally, enter the "Text" that will be shown as a tip when the user points the mouse to the hotspot.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B3				0	tg	Click the Apply button to apply your changes, and close the ImageMap Editor.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B7				0	tg	Save the document in the %PRODUCTNAME or HTML format.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	par_idN106BA				0	tg	You may save the ImageMap as a file and upload that file to a Web server, for example.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	tit				0	tg	Adding Clickable Hotspots to Images				2002-02-02 02:02:02
