helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3144433				0	tg	Press Enter to execute the selected icon. If the selected icon normally demands a consecutive mouse action, such as inserting a rectangle, then pressing the Enter key is not sufficient: in these cases press Ctrl+Enter.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3145116				0	tg	Ctrl+Home or Ctrl+End: scroll to the top or bottom of a table				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3145135				0	tg	If the object is anchored \<emph\>To character\</emph\>, the Arrow keys move it through the current paragraph.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3145195				0	tg	Space key: insert or remove a split				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3145251				0	tg	In a table control or in the data source view, the Tab key moves to the next column. To move to the next control, press Ctrl+Tab. To move to the previous control, press Shift+Ctrl+Tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
