helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\labels_database.xhp	0	help	par_id3154791	44			0	tg	In the data source view, select the records for which you would like address stickers, by clicking on the row headers to the left. Use the \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Shift\</item\> or \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl\</item\> key in the usual way to select several records at the same time.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
