helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3150753				0	tg	Then open the context menu in the Styles and Formatting window and select \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>. This opens the \<emph\>Character Style\</emph\> dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
