helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3152578				0	tg	Within the document, you can apply a separate language to any paragraph style. This has priority over the language of the whole document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3152886				0	tg	You can assign a language to selected pieces of text in a paragraph, either by direct formatting or with a character style. This assignment has priority over the paragraph style and document language.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
