helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3145272				0	tg	To convert Pocket PC formats to and from $[officename] formats, you must first change some options within ActiveSync. To do this, open the ActiveSync window and open its Options dialog. Perform the following steps:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
