helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pageformat_max.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149180				0	tg	\<variable id=\"pageformat_max\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/pageformat_max.xhp\" name=\"Selecting the Maximum Printable Area on a Page\"\>Selecting the Maximum Printable Area on a Page\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pageformat_max.xhp	0	help	par_id3145120				0	tg	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\> to close the dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pageformat_max.xhp	0	help	par_id3147335				0	tg	Under \<emph\>Margins\</emph\> you can define the maximum or minimum possible value for the page margins (left, right, top, and bottom). Click into the respective spin box, then press the (Page Up) or (Page Down) key. The preview displays a dashed line around the printable range.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pageformat_max.xhp	0	help	par_id3147653				0	tg	Select the \<emph\>Format - Page\</emph\> command, and go to the \<emph\>Page\</emph\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pageformat_max.xhp	0	help	par_id3149182				0	tg	$[officename] offers a semi-automatic feature that enables you to print as close to the paper's edge as is possible.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pageformat_max.xhp	0	help	par_id3155388				0	tg	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01130000.xhp\" name=\"Printing\"\>Printing\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pageformat_max.xhp	0	help	par_id3156114				0	tg	Make sure that the \<emph\>Web Layout\</emph\> in the \<emph\>View\</emph\> menu is not selected.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pageformat_max.xhp	0	help	par_id3156426				0	tg	Not all printers can print a paper up to its edges. Most of them leave an unprinted margin.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pageformat_max.xhp	0	help	par_id3159233				0	tg	Make sure that your printer has been setup under \<emph\>File - Printer Settings\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
