helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN1053A				0	tg	\<variable id=\"formatpaintbrush\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/paintbrush.xhp\"\>Copying Formatting With the Format Paintbrush\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10655				0	tg	You can use the Format Paintbrush tool to copy formatting from a text selection or object and apply the formatting to another text selection or object.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10660				0	tg	The cursor changes to a paint bucket.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10663				0	tg	If you want to apply the formatting to more than one selection, double-click the \<emph\>Format Paintbrush\</emph\> icon \<image id=\"img_id209967\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_formatpaintbrush.png\" width=\"0.1665inch\" height=\"0.1665inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id209967\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>. After you apply all the formatting, click the icon again.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10667				0	tg	On the \<emph\>Standard Bar\</emph\>, click the \<emph\>Format Paintbrush\</emph\> icon.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN1066E				0	tg	Select or click the text or object that you want to apply the formatting to.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10671				0	tg	The following table describes the formatting attributes that the \<emph\>Format Paintbrush\</emph\> can copy:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10691				0	tg	Type of Selection				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10697				0	tg	Шарҳ				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN1069E				0	tg	Nothing selected, but cursor is inside a text passage				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106A4				0	tg	Copies the formatting of the current paragraph and the character formatting of the next character in the text flow direction.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106AB				0	tg	Text is selected				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B1				0	tg	Copies the formatting of the last selected character and of the paragraph that contains the character.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B8				0	tg	Frame is selected				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106BE				0	tg	Copies the frame attributes that are defined in Format - Frame dialog. The contents, size, position, linking, hyperlinks, and macros in the frame are not copied.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106C5				0	tg	Object is selected				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106CB				0	tg	Copies the object formatting that is defined in the Format - Graphics or Format - Object dialogs. The contents, size, position, hyperlinks, and macros in the object are not copied.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D2				0	tg	Form control is selected				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D8				0	tg	Not supported				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106DD				0	tg	Select the text or object whose formatting you want to copy.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106DF				0	tg	Drawing object is selected				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106E5				0	tg	Copies all formatting attributes. In Impress and Draw, the text contents of the object is also copied.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EC				0	tg	Text within drawing object or within Calc cells is selected				2002-02-02 02:02:02
