helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10743				0	tg	Contents that are stored on the clipboard can be pasted into your document using different formats. In %PRODUCTNAME you can choose how to paste the contents using a dialog or a drop-down icon.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10746				0	tg	The available options depend on the contents of the clipboard.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10749				0	tg	Pasting clipboard contents using an icon menu				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10750				0	tg	Click the arrow next to the \<emph\>Paste\</emph\> icon on the Standard Bar to open the menu.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10758				0	tg	Select one of the options.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN1075B				0	tg	If you do not like the result, click the \<emph\>Undo\</emph\> icon and then paste again with another option.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
