helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3145313				0	tg	Select the option to print in black and white. For further information, refer to the user's manual of your printer.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3145610	16			0	tg	\<emph\>Black & white\</emph\> converts all colors into the two values black and white. All borders around objects are printed black. All text will be printed in black. A background set by \<emph\>Format - Page - Background\</emph\> will not be printed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3147084				0	tg	Then choose \<emph\>Print\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3147559				0	tg	In \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Writer you can choose to print color-formatted text in black and white. You can specify this either for all subsequent text documents to be printed, or only for the current printing process.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3147573	12			0	tg	Under \<emph\>Quality,\</emph\> select either \<emph\>Grayscale\</emph\> or \<emph\>Black & white\</emph\> and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3149233				0	tg	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Options - \</emph\>\<emph\>\<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>\</emph\>\<emph\> Impress \</emph\>or \<emph\>Tools - Options - \</emph\>\<emph\>\<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>\</emph\>\<emph\> Draw\</emph\>, as appropriate.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3149346				0	tg	Choose \<emph\>File - Print\</emph\>. The \<emph\>Print\</emph\> dialog opens.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3149560	26			0	tg	Click the \<emph\>Options\</emph\> button. This opens the \<emph\>Printer Options\</emph\> dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3149667				0	tg	Under \<emph\>Contents\</emph\> mark \<emph\>Print black\</emph\> and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3149786	15			0	tg	\<emph\>Grayscale\</emph\> converts all colors to a maximum of 256 gradations from black to white. All text will be printed in black. A background set by \<emph\>Format - Page - Background\</emph\> will not be printed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3150275				0	tg	Then choose \<emph\>Print\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3150541				0	tg	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Options - \</emph\>\<emph\>\<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>\</emph\>\<emph\> Writer \</emph\>or \<emph\>Tools - Options - \</emph\>\<emph\>\<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>\</emph\>\<emph\> Writer/Web\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3152933				0	tg	Choose \<emph\>File - Print\</emph\>. This opens the \<emph\>Print\</emph\> dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345				0	tg	Confirm the \<emph\>Properties\</emph\> dialog and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Print\</emph\> dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3153726				0	tg	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01130000.xhp\" name=\"Printing dialogs\"\>Printing dialogs\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3154146				0	tg	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01000000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options dialog\"\>Tools - Options dialog\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3154307				0	tg	When either of these options is selected, all presentations or drawings will be printed without color. If you only want to print in black for the \<emph\>current\</emph\> print job, select the option in \<emph\>File - Print - Options\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3154910	22			0	tg	Under \<emph\>Contents,\</emph\> mark \<emph\>Print black\</emph\> and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3155308	28			0	tg	The text document or HTML document now being printed will be printed in black text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
