helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_protect.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159201	1			0	tg	\<variable id=\"redlining_protect\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/redlining_protect.xhp\" name=\"Protecting Records\"\>Protecting Records\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
