helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\scripting.xhp	0	help	par_idN107A6				0	tg	To assign a script to a form control				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\scripting.xhp	0	help	par_idN107AA				0	tg	Insert a form control, for example a button: Open the Form Controls toolbar, click the \<emph\>Push Button\</emph\> icon, drag open a button on your document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
