helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\workfolder.xhp	0	help	par_id3153880				0	tg	In the \<emph\>Select Path\</emph\> dialog, choose the work directory you want and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
