helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3156291				0	tg	Typing errors are highlighted in the document with a red underline. If you place the cursor over a word marked in this way, you can open the context menu to obtain a list of corrections. Select a correction to replace the word. If you make the same mistake again while editing the document, it will be marked as an error again.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
