helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145135				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"SC_CHECKBOX_RID_SCPAGE_CONTENT_CB_OUTLINE\"\>Агар шумо \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/12080000.xhp\" name=\"outline\"\>ҳошия\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>ҳошия\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> муқаррар карда бошед, параметри \<emph\>Рамзҳои ҳошия\</emph\> муайян месозад, ки рамзҳои ҳошия дар сарҳадоти варақ нишон дода шаванд.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3146974				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"SC_CHECKBOX_RID_SCPAGE_CONTENT_CB_ANNOT\"\>Specifies that a small rectangle in the top right corner of the cell indicates that a note exists. The note will be shown only when you enable tips under \<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME - General\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
