helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148400				0	tg	Градиент				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148489				0	tg	Rotates or skews the selected 2D object(s) around a pivot point. Drag a corner handle of the object in the direction you want to rotate it. To skew an object, drag a center handle in the direction you want to skew it.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149018	4			0	tg	To open the\<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Draw \<emph\>Mode \</emph\>toolbar, click the arrow next to the \<emph\>Effects \</emph\>icon on the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar. In %PRODUCTNAME Impress, choose \<emph\>View - Toolbars - Mode\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149024				0	tg	дар ҷисми даврзанандаи сеченака				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149454				0	tg	Set in circle (perspective)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149594	47			0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InteractiveGradient\"\>Modifies the gradient fill of the selected object. This command is only available if you applied a gradient to the selected object in \<emph\>Format - Area\</emph\>.\</ahelp\> Drag the handles of the gradient line to change the direction of the gradient or the length of the gradient. You can also drag and drop colors onto the handles from the \<emph\>Color\</emph\> Bar to change the color of the gradient endpoints. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149665				0	tg	\<image id=\"img_id3154490\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_toggleobjectrotatemode.png\" width=\"5.64mm\" height=\"5.64mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154490\"\>Тасвир\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149756				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Shear\"\>Lets you drag the handles of the selected object to change its shape.\</ahelp\> If the selected object is not a polygon or Bézier curve, you are prompted to change the object to a curve before you can distort it.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150332	36			0	tg	Drag the symmetry line to a new location to change the shape of the converted object. To change the orientation of the symmetry line, drag one of its end points. Click the object to convert it to 3D. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150435				0	tg	Даврзанӣ				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150468				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:CrookRotate\"\>Distorts the selected object by wrapping it around imaginary circles, and then adding perspective. Drag a handle of the selected object to distort it.\</ahelp\> If the selected object is not a polygon or Bézier curve, you are prompted to change the object to a curve before you can distort it.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
