helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147256				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Freeline\"\>Draws a freeform line where you drag in the slide. When you release, $[officename] creates a closed shape by drawing a straight line segment from the endpoint to the starting point of the line. The shape within the lines will be filled with the current area color.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147301				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:LineToolbox\"\>The Curve icon on the Drawing bar opens the \<emph\>Lines\</emph\> toolbar, where you can add lines and shapes to the current slide.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148773				0	tg	\<image id=\"img_id3150936\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_bezierfill.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150936\"\>Тасвир\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
