helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146124				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:MeasureLine\"\>Draws a line that displays the dimension length bounded by guides.\</ahelp\> Dimension lines automatically calculate and display linear dimensions. To draw a dimension line, open the \<emph\>Arrows\</emph\> toolbar, and click the \<emph\>Dimension Line\</emph\> icon. Move your pointer to where you want the line to start and drag to draw the dimension line. Release when finished.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
