helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147405				0	tg	\<image id=\"img_id3147299\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_line.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3147299\"\>Тасвир\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148407				0	tg	If you want the dimension line to be the same length as the side of a nearby object, hold down the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> key while dragging. To constrain the dimension line to 45 degrees, hold down the Shift key while dragging.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
