helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090500.xhp	0	help	par_id3155913				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_LRANGLEX\"\>Inserts a placeholder within angle brackets.\</ahelp\> You can also type \<emph\>langle <?> rangle\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
