helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090500.xhp	0	help	par_idN113E5				0	tg	Examples of single brackets				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090500.xhp	0	help	par_idN113E8				0	tg	For non-scaled brackets:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090500.xhp	0	help	par_idN113EB				0	tg	a = \\{ \\( \\[ b newline				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090500.xhp	0	help	par_idN113EE				0	tg	{} + c \\] \\) \\ }				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090500.xhp	0	help	par_idN113F3				0	tg	For scaled brackets use \<emph\>none\</emph\> as the bracket name				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090500.xhp	0	help	par_idN113FA				0	tg	a = left ( a over b right none newline				2002-02-02 02:02:02
