helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090800.xhp	0	help	par_id3154224				0	tg	Be sure to leave spaces (gaps) between values and commands when entering them manually in the Commands window. This ensures that the correct structure is achieved.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
