helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146923				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_INTERATTRIBUT_DIST\"\>Determines the minimum distance between a symbol and variable.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
