helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145776				0	tg	To quickly jump to the footnote or endnote text, click the anchor for note in the document. You can also position the cursor in front of or behind the marker, and then press Ctrl+Shift+PgDn. To jump back to the anchor for the note, press PgUp.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
