helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145249				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:PrintLayout\"\>Displays how the document will look when you print it.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03130000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	tg	Print Layout				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155959				0	tg	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/03140000.xhp\" name=\"Hidden Paragraphs\"\>Hidden Paragraphs\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3083451				0	tg	When you hide a paragraph, footnotes, and frames that are anchored to characters in the paragraph are also hidden.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150251				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ShowHiddenParagraphs\"\>Shows or hides hidden paragraphs.\</ahelp\> This option only affects the screen display of hidden paragraphs, and not the printing of hidden paragraphs.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154501				0	tg	Use the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"field command\"\>field command\</link\> "Hidden Paragraph" to assign a \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090200.xhp\" name=\"condition\"\>condition\</link\> that must be met to hide a paragraph. If the condition is not met, the paragraph is displayed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3157875				0	tg	To enable this feature, choose \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040600.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options - Writer - Formatting Aids\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Formatting Aids\</emph\>\</link\>, and ensure that the \<emph\>Hidden paragraphs\</emph\> check box in the \<emph\>Display of\</emph\> area is selected.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
