helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153677	3			0	tg	To jump to a specific bookmark, press F5 to open the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"Navigator\"\>Navigator\</link\>, click the plus sign (+) next to the\<emph\> Bookmark\</emph\> entry, and then double-click the bookmark.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
