helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150138				0	tg	\<variable id=\"datumuhrzeitformat\"\>When you click "Additional formats", the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05020300.xhp\" name=\"Number Format\"\>\<emph\>Number Format\</emph\>\</link\> dialog opens, where you can define a custom format. \</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
