helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3146865	22			0	tg	You can also insert database fields in the \<emph\>Then \</emph\>and \<emph\>Else \</emph\>boxes using the format "databasename.tablename.fieldname".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
