helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147455	65			0	tg	This dialog is shown when you click an \<emph\>Input list\</emph\> field in the document. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147473				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_PUSHBUTTON_TP_FLD_FUNC_PB_LISTADD\"\>Adds the \<emph\>Item\</emph\> to the list.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147515	10			0	tg	Inserts a text field that runs a macro when you click the field in the document. To assign a macro to the field, click the \<emph\>Macro\</emph\> button. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147524				0	tg	Inserts a text field that is hidden when the condition that you specify is met. To use this function, choose \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040600.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options - Text Document - Formatting Aids\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Formatting Aids\</emph\>\</link\> and clear the \<emph\>Fields: Hidden text\</emph\> check box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147564				0	tg	Inserts a text field that displays one item from a list. You can add, edit, and remove items, and change their order in the list. Click an \<emph\>Input list\</emph\> field in your document or press Ctrl+Shift+F9 to display the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090003.xhp\" name=\"Choose Item\"\>\<emph\>Choose Item\</emph\>\</link\> dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147583				0	tg	If the table or the field name does not exist in a database, nothing is inserted.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
