helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3149287				0	tg	Inserts a text field that you can open by \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090100.xhp\" name=\"clicking\"\>clicking\</link\> it in the document. You can then change the text that is displayed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
