helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150028				0	tg	You can include user data when you define conditions. To change your user data, choose \<emph\>Tools - Options - $[officename] - User data\</emph\>. User data must be entered in the form of strings. You can query the user data with "==" (EQ), "!=" (NEQ), or "!"(NOT).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
