helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120211.xhp	0	help	par_id3151253				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:TP_TOX_SELECT:CB_FROMHEADINGS\"\>Creates the index using outline levels, that is, paragraphs formatted with one of the predefined heading styles (Heading 1-10) are added to the index.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120211.xhp	0	help	par_id3152772				0	tg	\<variable id=\"vorlg\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:TP_TOX_SELECT:CB_ADDSTYLES\"\>Includes the paragraph styles that you specify in the \<emph\>Assign Styles\</emph\> dialog as index entries. To select the paragraph styles that you want to include in the index, click the \<emph\>Assign Styles (...\</emph\>) button to the right of this box.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
