helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120212.xhp	0	help	par_id3083451				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_TOX_SELECT_CB_USEFF\"\>Replaces identical index entries that occur on the same page, or consecutive pages, with a single entry that lists the page number with a "p" or "pp" where the entry first occurs. For example, the entries "View 10, View 11, View 12" are combined as "View 10pp", and "View 10, View 10" as "View 10p).\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120212.xhp	0	help	par_id3145825				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_TOX_SELECT_CB_USE_DASH\"\>Replaces identical index entries that occur on consecutive pages with a single entry and the page range where the entry occurs. For example, the entries "View 10, View 11, View 12" are combined as "View 10-12".\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120212.xhp	0	help	par_id3147170				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_TOX_SELECT_CB_KEYASENTRY\"\>Inserts index keys as separate index entries.\</ahelp\> A key is inserted as a top level index entry and the entries that are assigned to the key as indented subentries.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120212.xhp	0	help	par_id3147530				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_TOX_SELECT_LB_SORTALG\"\>Select numeric when you want to sort numbers by value, such as in 1, 2, 12. Select alphanumeric, when you want to sort the numbers by character code, such as in 1, 12, 2.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120212.xhp	0	help	par_id3148772				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_TOX_SELECT_CB_INITIALCAPS\"\>Automatically capitalizes the first letter of an index entry.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
