helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3154638	7			0	tg	The \<emph\>Structure \</emph\>line displays the table of contents code for the selected heading level. To change the appearance of a heading level you can enter codes or text in the empty boxes on this line. You can also click in an empty box or on a code, and then click a code button.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
