helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3148386				0	tg	Click in the document that you want to change the data source for.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149053				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_MODALDIALOG_DLG_CHANGE_DB\"\>Lists the databases that are currently in use.\</ahelp\> The current document contains at least one data field from each of the databases in the list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
