helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149880				0	tg	An inserted script is indicated by a small green rectangle. If you do not see the rectangle, choose \<emph\>Tools - Options - HTML Document\</emph\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040200.xhp\" name=\"View\"\>\<emph\>View\</emph\>\</link\>, and select the \<emph\>Notes \</emph\>check box. To edit a script, double-click the green rectangle.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
