helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147220	30			0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:METRICFIELD:TP_FORMAT_TABLE:ED_RIGHT_DIST\"\>Enter the amount of space that you want to leave between the right page margin and the edge of the table.\</ahelp\> This option is not available if the \<emph\>Automatic \</emph\>or the \<emph\>Right\</emph\> option is selected in the \<emph\>Alignment\</emph\> area.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
