helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150934				0	tg	Outline numbering is linked to paragraph styles. By default, the "Heading" paragraph styles (1-10) are assigned to the corresponding outline number levels (1-10). If you want, you can assign different paragraph styles to the outline number level.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150979				0	tg	The \<emph\>Format\</emph\> button is only available for outline numbering. For numbered or bulleted list styles, modify the Numbering Styles of the paragraphs.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
