helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06180000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150249	2			0	tg	\<variable id=\"zeinum\"\>Adds or removes and formats line numbers in the current document. To exclude a paragraph from line numbering, click in the paragraph, choose \<emph\>Format - Paragraph\</emph\>, click the \<emph\>Numbering \</emph\>tab, and then clear the \<emph\>Include this paragraph in line numbering\</emph\> check box.\</variable\> You can also exclude a paragraph style from line numbering.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06180000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150358				0	tg	Specify whether to include empty paragraphs or lines in text frames in the line count.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06180000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150765				0	tg	You can enter a separator character to display between line numbers if the counting interval is more than one.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
