helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\06130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148770				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:MoveDownSubItems\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Moves a paragraph with all its subpoints below the following paragraph.\</ahelp\> This is only visible when the cursor is positioned within numbered or bulleted text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
