helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147403	2			0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Click to open the Fields dialog. Click the arrow next to the icon to open a submenu.\</ahelp\>Click to open the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\"\>Fields\</link\> dialog. Click the arrow next to the icon to open a submenu.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154503				0	tg	You can choose from the following functions:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	tg	Иловакунии майдон				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151175				0	tg	\<link href=\"text/swriter/02/18030100.xhp\" name=\"Date\"\>Date\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147511				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertDateField\"\>Inserts the current date as a field.\</ahelp\> The default date format is used, and the date is not automatically updated.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151312				0	tg	If you would like to define a different date format, or have the date updated automatically, select \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\> to insert a field command and make the desired settings in the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Fields\"\>\<emph\>Fields\</emph\>\</link\> dialog. The format of an existing date field can be modified at any time by choosing \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02140000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Fields\"\>\<emph\>Edit - Fields\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	tg	Сана				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030200.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147174				0	tg	\<bookmark_value\>time fields;inserting\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>fields;inserting time\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147174				0	tg	\<link href=\"text/swriter/02/18030200.xhp\" name=\"Time\"\>Time\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151177				0	tg	To assign a different time format, or adapt the actual time data, select \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\> and make the desired changes in the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Fields\"\>\<emph\>Fields\</emph\>\</link\> dialog. Additionally, you can modify the format of an inserted time field at any time by choosing \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02140000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Fields\"\>\<emph\>Edit - Fields\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030200.xhp	0	help	par_id3152896				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertTimeField\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Inserts the current time as a field.\</ahelp\> The time is taken directly from the system settings of your operating system. A fixed time format is applied, which cannot be updated by using the F9 function key.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030200.xhp	0	help	tit				0	tg	Вақт				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147173				0	tg	\<link href=\"text/swriter/02/18030300.xhp\" name=\"Page Numbers\"\>Page Numbers\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150760				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertPageNumberField\"\>Inserts the current page number as a field at the cursor position.\</ahelp\> The default setting is the Page Style format.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3151175				0	tg	If you would like to define a different format or modify the page number, insert a field with \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\> and make the desired settings in the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Fields\"\>\<emph\>Fields\</emph\>\</link\> dialog. It is also possible to edit a field inserted with the \<emph\>Page Numbers\</emph\> command with \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02140000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Fields\"\>\<emph\>Edit - Fields\</emph\>\</link\>. To change page numbers, read the \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/pagenumbers.xhp\" name=\"Page Numbers\"\>\<emph\>Page Numbers\</emph\>\</link\> guide.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030300.xhp	0	help	tit				0	tg	Page Numbers				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145828				0	tg	\<link href=\"text/swriter/02/18030400.xhp\" name=\"Page Count\"\>Page Count\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030400.xhp	0	help	par_id3148772				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertPageCountField\"\>Inserts as a field the total number of pages in the document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149294				0	tg	If you wish to have the page number formatted with a different numbering style, choose \<emph\>Insert - Field - Other\</emph\> to insert the required field, and specify the settings in the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Field\"\>\<emph\>Field\</emph\>\</link\> dialog. The format of the field inserted using the \<emph\>Page Number\</emph\> command can also be modified using the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02140000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Field\"\>\<emph\>Edit - Field\</emph\>\</link\> command.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030400.xhp	0	help	tit				0	tg	Шумораи саҳифаҳо				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030500.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147169				0	tg	\<bookmark_value\>subject; inserting as field\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>fields; subject\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147169				0	tg	\<link href=\"text/swriter/02/18030500.xhp\" name=\"Subject\"\>Subject\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030500.xhp	0	help	par_id3152892				0	tg	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertTopicField\"\>Inserts the subject specified in the document properties as a field .\</ahelp\> This field displays the data entered in the \<emph\>Subject\</emph\> field under \<emph\>File - Properties - Description\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030500.xhp	0	help	par_id3156380				0	tg	If you would like to insert a different document property as a field, select \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\> and make the desired settings in the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Fields\"\>\<emph\>Fields\</emph\>\</link\> dialog. The \<emph\>DocInformation\</emph\> category contains all of the fields shown in the document properties.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030500.xhp	0	help	tit				0	tg	Мавзӯъ				2002-02-02 02:02:02
