helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id2357860				0	tg	The automatic numbering option is only applied to paragraphs that are formatted with the "Default", "Text body", or "Text body indent" paragraph style.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3147287				0	tg	You can start a numbered list with any number.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3147773				0	tg	Type 1., i., or I. to start a numbered list. Type * or - to start a bulleted list. You can also type a right parenthesis after the number instead of a period , for example, 1) or i).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3147794				0	tg	Enter a space, type your text, and then press Enter. The new paragraph automatically receives the next number or bullet.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3147814				0	tg	Press Enter again to finish the list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
