helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	par_id3147759	6			0	tg	If you choose a word from the \<emph\>AutoCorrect\</emph\> submenu, the underlined word and the replacement word are automatically added to the \<emph\>AutoCorrect\</emph\> list for the current language. To view the \<emph\>AutoCorrect\</emph\> list, choose \<emph\>Tools - AutoCorrect\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Replace\</emph\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
