helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\autotext.xhp	0	help	par_id3145668	30			0	tg	You can also type the shortcut for an AutoText entry, and then press F3, or click the arrow next to the \<emph\>AutoText \</emph\>icon on the \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> bar, and then choose an AutoText entry. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
