helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\autotext.xhp	0	help	par_id3150534				0	tg	In $[officename] Writer, you can store text - also containing graphics, tables, and fields - as AutoText, so that you can quickly insert the text later on. If you want, you can also store formatted text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\autotext.xhp	0	help	par_id3151277				0	tg	Select "AutoText" and then click \<emph\>Run\</emph\>. A list of the current AutoText entries is generated in a separate text document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\autotext.xhp	0	help	par_id3151304				0	tg	Choose \<emph\>File - Print\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\autotext.xhp	0	help	par_id3151355				0	tg	You can store AutoText entries in different directories on a network.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\autotext.xhp	0	help	par_id3151370				0	tg	For example, you can store "read-only" AutoText entries for your company on a central server, and user-defined AutoText entries in a local directory.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\autotext.xhp	0	help	par_id3151390				0	tg	Роҳҳо ба Автоислоҳкуниро дар ҷӯрсозиҳо ислоҳ кардан мумкин аст.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
