helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_clipboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147692				0	tg	\<variable id=\"calculate_clipboard\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/calculate_clipboard.xhp\" name=\" Calculating and Pasting the Result of a Formula in a Text Document\"\> Calculating and Pasting the Result of a Formula in a Text Document\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_clipboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3150512	40			0	tg	Place the cursor where you want to insert the result of the formula, and then choose \<emph\>Edit - Paste\</emph\>, or press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+V.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_clipboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3154250				0	tg	Select the formula in the text. The formula can only contain numbers and operators and cannot contain spaces.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_clipboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155496	38			0	tg	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Calculate\</emph\>, or press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Plus Sign (+).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_clipboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155547	41			0	tg	If the formula is selected, it is replaced by the result.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_clipboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3156366				0	tg	If your text already contains a formula, for example "12+24*2", $[officename] can calculate, and then paste the result of the formula in your document, without using the \<emph\>Formula Bar\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_clipboard.xhp	0	help	tit				0	tg	Calculating and Pasting the Result of a Formula in a Text Document				2002-02-02 02:02:02
