helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions_numbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3155553				0	tg	Type the character that you want to separate the chapter number(s) from the caption number in the\<emph\> Separator\</emph\> box, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
