helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3150167				0	tg	The mouse pointer changes to a hand when you rest it over a footnote or endnote anchor in your document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3150508				0	tg	In the \<emph\>Type \</emph\>area, select \<emph\>Footnote \</emph\>or \<emph\>Endnote\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
