helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3154251				0	tg	Right-click the Paragraph Style that you want to modify, for example, "Footnote", and choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
