helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3146863				0	tg	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\> and click the\<emph\> Document\</emph\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3147065				0	tg	Click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> and then click \<emph\>Close\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3147095				0	tg	The header on every page that uses the current page style automatically displays the chapter name and number.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3147124				0	tg	Select the numbering style for the chapter titles in the \<emph\>Number \</emph\>box, for example, "1,2,3...".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150219				0	tg	Type "Chapter" followed by a space in the \<emph\>Before \</emph\>box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150245				0	tg	Enter a space in the \<emph\>After \</emph\>box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150527				0	tg	Apply the paragraph style that you defined for chapter titles to the chapter headings in your document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150949				0	tg	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
