helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagenumbers.xhp	0	help	par_id9029206				0	tg	You want roman page numbers running i, ii, iii, iv, and so on.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagenumbers.xhp	0	help	par_id9139378				0	tg	Select a number format and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
