helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3153376				0	tg	To apply the custom page style to more than one page, select its name in the \<emph\>Next Style\</emph\> box. To stop using the style, insert a manual page break and assign it a different page style.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
