helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_id8947416				0	tg	If your printer prints duplex, and because brochures always print in landscape mode, you should use the "duplex - short edge" setting in your printer setup dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN105F6				0	tg	\<variable id=\"print_brochure\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/print_brochure.xhp\"\>Printing a Brochure\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN10614				0	tg	You can print a Writer document as a brochure or a booklet. That is, Writer prints two pages on each side of the paper, so that when you fold the paper, you can read the document as a book.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
