helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN106DE				0	tg	When you create a document that you want to print as a brochure, use portrait orientation for the pages. Writer applies the brochure layout when you print the document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
