helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\removing_line_breaks.xhp	0	help	par_id3149645				0	tg	On the \<emph\>Options\</emph\> tab, ensure that \<emph\>Combine single line paragraphs if length greater than 50%\</emph\> is selected. To change the minimum percentage for the line length, double-click the option in the list, and then enter a new percentage.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\removing_line_breaks.xhp	0	help	par_id3153138	5			0	tg	Choose \<emph\>Tools - AutoCorrect.\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
