helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3149609				0	tg	To hide a section, select the \<emph\>Hide \</emph\>check box in the \<emph\>Hide \</emph\>area.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3149631				0	tg	To make a section read-only, select the \<emph\>Protected \</emph\>check box in the \<emph\>Write Protection \</emph\>area.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3149848				0	tg	In the \<emph\>Section \</emph\>list, click the section you want to modify.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3149874	21			0	tg	Set the other options that you want, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
