helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149611				0	tg	When you open a document that contains linked sections, $[officename] prompts you to update the contents of the sections. To manually update a link, choose \<emph\>Tools - Update - Links\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
