helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3155882				0	tg	Locate the document containing the section that you want to link to, and then click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3155917				0	tg	You can insert new sections, or links to sections in other documents into the current document. If you insert a section as a link, the content of the link changes when you modify the source document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
