helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id3145390	27			0	tg	Rest the mouse pointer over the column dividing line on the ruler until the pointer becomes a separator icon, and then drag the line to a new location.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
