helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3149956				0	tg	For example, enable the automatic hyphenation option for the "Default" paragraph style, and then apply the style to the paragraphs that you want to hyphenate.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
