helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3154244				0	tg	If you insert a manual hyphen in a word, the word is only hyphenated at the manual hyphen. No additional automatic hyphenation is applied for this word. A word with a manual hyphen will be hyphenated without regard to the settings on the \<emph\>Text Flow\</emph\> tab page.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
