helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN10711				0	tg	When you press Enter in a numbered or bulleted list, \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> automatically numbers the next paragraph. To remove the numbering or bullet from the new paragraph, press Enter again.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN1072B				0	tg	To change the hierarchical level of a bullet in a list, click in front of the paragraph, then press the Tab key.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
