helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN10733				0	tg	To change the bullet or numbering format for all paragraphs in the list, ensure that the cursor is in the list, choose Bullets and Numbering, and then click a new format. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN10737				0	tg	To apply the same bullet or numbering format to all paragraphs in the list, select all paragraphs, choose Bullets and Numbering, and then click a format.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN1073A				0	tg	You can also use the commands on the \<link href=\"text/swriter/main0206.xhp\" name=\"Numbering Object Bar\"\>Bullets and Numbering\</link\> toolbar to edit a numbered or bulleted list. To change the numbering or bullet format, click the \<emph\>Bullets and Numbering\</emph\> icon.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	tit				0	tg	Numbering and Numbering Styles				2002-02-02 02:02:02
