helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion.xhp	0	help	par_idN1076F				0	tg	$[officename] collects words that you frequently use in the current session. When you later type the first three letters of a collected word, $[officename] automatically completes the word. If you want, you can also save the current list of collected words so that it can be used in the next session. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
